Subject: Cantor M2B Supplied Ordered Topology Inventory Digest

Description: Canonical SJS authority for one zero-effect, versioned, architecture-independent canonical encoding and SHA-256 commitment over the exact ordered TopologyEntryObservation sequence retained by a completed supplied topology inventory assembly. Success retains complete supplied lineage and grants no physical enumeration, completeness, temporal, receipt, admission, or mutation authority.

